### Ingest SPY daily prices
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/ingest/SPY

### Ingest QQQ daily prices
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/ingest/QQQ

### Ingest VTI daily prices
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/ingest/VTI

### Get SPY price history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/SPY/prices

### Get Non-Existent Ticker
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/ZZZ/prices

### Compare funds
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/compare?tickers=SPY,QQQ,VTI&from=2024-01-01

### Get Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/SPY/metrics
Accept: application/json

### Get Non-Existent Ticker Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/FAKE/metrics
Accept: application/json

### All-time (no params)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/SPY/metrics
Accept: application/json

### Windowed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/SPY/metrics?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-06-30
Accept: application/json

### from only (defaults 'to' to today)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/SPY/metrics?from=2025-01-01
Accept: application/json

### Reversed range -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/SPY/metrics?from=2025-06-30&to=2025-01-01
Accept: application/json